1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,869
He paid 10,000 bitcoins...

2
00:00:01,869 --> 00:00:03,013
for two pizzas.

3
00:00:03,013 --> 00:00:05,318
Back then: about $41.

4
00:00:05,318 --> 00:00:06,955
At bitcoin's peak?

5
00:00:06,955 --> 00:00:09,738
$1.26 BILLION.

6
00:00:09,738 --> 00:00:10,655
And he wasn't a newbie:

7
00:00:10,655 --> 00:00:11,212
he says he wrote

8
00:00:11,212 --> 00:00:13,104
the first GPU miner.

9
00:00:13,104 --> 00:00:14,718
Four days after his offer,

10
00:00:14,718 --> 00:00:15,948
a California teenager

11
00:00:15,948 --> 00:00:18,052
had two large Papa John's delivered.

12
00:00:18,052 --> 00:00:19,259
The pizzas cost the kid

13
00:00:19,259 --> 00:00:20,676
about $25.

14
00:00:20,676 --> 00:00:21,895
And Laszlo?

15
00:00:21,895 --> 00:00:23,506
He made the same offer again.

16
00:00:23,506 --> 00:00:24,551
Then he wrote:

17
00:00:24,551 --> 00:00:25,584
"I can't really afford

18
00:00:25,584 --> 00:00:26,612
to keep doing it."

19
00:00:26,612 --> 00:00:27,727
In all, he says he

20
00:00:27,727 --> 00:00:30,025
spent about 100,000 bitcoins.

21
00:00:30,025 --> 00:00:31,330
Much of it on pizza.

22
00:00:31,330 --> 00:00:32,514
Regrets? "You know,

23
00:00:32,514 --> 00:00:33,340
I don't regret it."
